  "utm-accounting:1": {"title":"Admission requirements: Accounting (limited enrolment)","body":"Below are the admission highlights for this program (based on the official UofT calendar):","items":["The Accounting Specialist is limited enrolment: students apply after completing at least 4.0 credits, needing ECO101+ECO102 (each ≥63%), MGM101 and MGT120 (each ≥63%) and a math sequence (≥63%), with a weighted average at that year's cut-off (set annually by the department)","17.5 credits in total","The Co-op stream also requires MGT262 or MGT231 before a work term can begin"]},
