  "utm-accounting:3": {"title":"Third year: Accounting","body":"Below are the notes for this year:","items":["Third year requires MGT300 (strategy), MGT321 (accounting information systems), MGT323 (auditing), MGT325 (corporate finance), MGT326 (taxation), MGT393 (accounting theory/practice), 0.5 credit of 200/300/400-level MGT electives and econometrics (ECO220 or ECO227 or a statistics combination)"]},
